---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="எங்களைப் பற்றி - கூவல்">
<!-- Hero Section: Editorial Storytelling -->
<section class="section-gap pt-stack-lg md:pt-section-gap grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-center">
<div class="md:col-span-7 reveal">
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary mb-4 block">OUR IDENTITY</span>
<h1 class="font-display-lg text-display-lg-mobile md:text-display-lg text-primary mb-8 leading-[1.1]">
                    கலையும் இலக்கியமும்<br/><span class="italic font-normal">புதிய தளத்தில்.</span>
</h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant max-w-xl">
                    Koovel is a curated sanctuary for Tamil thought. We bridge the gap between traditional literary depth and modern intellectual discourse, fostering a global community through the lens of botanical elegance and scholarly rigor.
                </p>
</div>
<div class="md:col-span-5 reveal delay-200">
<div class="relative w-full aspect-[3/4] rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-2xl">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-alt="An artistic, high-key editorial photograph of a blooming Jasmine flower against a soft cream background. The lighting is ethereal and soft, reflecting a botanical luxury aesthetic. The composition is minimalist with generous negative space, emphasizing the intricate details of the white petals and green leaves. The overall mood is scholarly, peaceful, and premium, aligned with the Koovel brand colors." src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516575334481-f85287c2c82d?w=800&h=1000&fit=crop&q=80"/>
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-primary/20 to-transparent"></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Divider -->
<div class="py-stack-lg reveal">
<div class="botanical-divider">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined botanical-glyph" data-weight="fill">spa</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Mission & Philosophy: Asymmetric Grid -->
<section class="section-gap grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter">
<div class="md:col-span-5 md:mt-24 reveal">
<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mb-6">The Philosophy</h2>
<div class="space-y-6 font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
<p>At Koovel, we believe that literature is a living, breathing ecosystem. Just as a garden requires careful nurturing and diversity to thrive, our cultural landscape depends on the cultivation of pluralistic voices and nuanced dialogue.</p>
<p>Our editorial lens is one of "Refined Botanical Luxury." We seek the organic beauty in Tamil prose and poetry, treating every published piece as a rare specimen in a grand intellectual conservatory.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="md:col-start-7 md:col-span-6 reveal delay-100">
<div class="p-12 glass-card rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30">
<h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mb-6">Our Mission</h2>
<blockquote class="font-display-lg text-headline-md italic text-on-surface mb-8 border-l-4 border-secondary pl-8">
                        "தமிழ் இலக்கியத்தின் ஆழத்தையும் பன்முகத்தன்மையையும் உலகளாவிய வாசகர்களுக்குக் கொண்டு செல்வதே எமது நோக்கம்."
                    </blockquote>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">
                        To preserve the sanctity of the written word while embracing the digital evolution. We strive to create a space where the scent of old parchment meets the clarity of modern design, ensuring Tamil literature remains a vibrant force in the global zeitgeist.
                    </p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Meet the Team -->
<section class="section-gap">
<div class="text-center mb-16 reveal">
<span class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest block mb-4">THE CURATORS</span>
<h2 class="font-display-lg text-headline-md md:text-display-lg text-primary">Meet the Team</h2>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-gutter">
<!-- Team Member 1 -->
<div class="team-card transition-all duration-500 reveal">
<div class="aspect-square rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-6 mx-auto w-48 border-4 border-surface-container">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700" data-alt="A warm, professional headshot of a Tamil scholar in their late 40s. They are smiling warmly, wearing elegant traditional attire. The background is a soft-focus library with botanical elements. Soft, natural light illuminates the face. High-end editorial style, warm tones, reflecting the refined botanical luxury theme." src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1455390582262-044cdead277a?w=800&h=800&fit=crop&q=80"/>
</div>
<div class="text-center">
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-[24px] text-primary">Dr. இளங்கோவன்</h3>
<p class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary mb-2">Editor-in-Chief</p>
<p class="font-caption text-caption text-on-surface-variant px-4">A visionary scholar dedicated to the revival of classical Tamil poetics in modern discourse.</p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Team Member 2 -->
<div class="team-card transition-all duration-500 reveal delay-100">
<div class="aspect-square rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-6 mx-auto w-48 border-4 border-surface-container">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700" data-alt="A warm portrait of a young Tamil woman artist with creative spectacles, smiling. She has a minimalist, modern aesthetic. The background features subtle abstract floral wallpaper. Soft lighting, pastel tones of lavender and cream. Editorial magazine quality." src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470252649378-9c29740c9fa8?w=800&h=1000&fit=crop&q=80"/>
</div>
<div class="text-center">
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-[24px] text-primary">கவிப்பிரியா</h3>
<p class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary mb-2">Creative Director</p>
<p class="font-caption text-caption text-on-surface-variant px-4">Merging traditional motifs with contemporary design to shape the journal's visual identity.</p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Team Member 3 -->
<div class="team-card transition-all duration-500 reveal delay-200">
<div class="aspect-square rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-6 mx-auto w-48 border-4 border-surface-container">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700" data-alt="A close-up portrait of an elderly man with a kind face and salt-and-pepper hair, a renowned literary critic. He is looking thoughtfully at the camera. Warm, soft side-lighting from a window. High-end editorial style, warm off-white tones." src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580489944761-15a19d654956?w=400&h=400&fit=crop&q=80"/>
</div>
<div class="text-center">
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-[24px] text-primary">பேராசிரியர் சேகர்</h3>
<p class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary mb-2">Lead Critic</p>
<p class="font-caption text-caption text-on-surface-variant px-4">Decades of expertise in archival research and contemporary literary criticism.</p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Team Member 4 -->
<div class="team-card transition-all duration-500 reveal delay-300">
<div class="aspect-square rounded-full overflow-hidden mb-6 mx-auto w-48 border-4 border-surface-container">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700" data-alt="A youthful Tamil man in his 30s, energetic and modern, representing the digital transformation. Professional portrait, soft lighting, clean background with a small potted sage plant visible. Minimalist and refined botanical luxury style." src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1633332755192-727a05c4013d?w=400&h=400&fit=crop&q=80"/>
</div>
<div class="text-center">
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-[24px] text-primary">மாதவன்</h3>
<p class="font-label-caps text-label-caps text-secondary mb-2">Digital Curator</p>
<p class="font-caption text-caption text-on-surface-variant px-4">Bridging the gap between the physical journal and our global digital community.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>

<script is:inline>
// Scroll reveal logic
        const observerOptions = {
            threshold: 0.1,
            rootMargin: '0px 0px -50px 0px'
        };

        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
            entries.forEach(entry => {
                if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                    entry.target.classList.add('active');
                }
            });
        }, observerOptions);

        document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el => observer.observe(el));

        // Interaction micro-animations
        document.querySelectorAll('button, a').forEach(el => {
            el.addEventListener('mousedown', () => {
                el.style.transform = 'scale(0.96)';
            });
            el.addEventListener('mouseup', () => {
                el.style.transform = '';
            });
        });
</script>
